WEBVTT

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:36.900 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:39.930 line:0%
[Episode 40]

00:01:40.279 --> 00:01:41.960 line:0%
Mother, please

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:45.640 line:0%
punish Zhang Xingwei according to the law.

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:47.450 line:0%
But

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:49.960 line:0%
as for other members of the Zhang family,

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:52.480 line:0%
please show leniency for the sake

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:53.970 line:0%
of their past merits.

00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:16.420 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:19.760 line:0%
The Zhang family

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:22.040 line:0%
has served as prime ministers for three generations.

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:24.200 line:0%
They made great contributions to Cang State.

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:25.320 line:0%
One person's fault

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:28.280 line:0%
shouldn't implicate the entire family.

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:31.020 line:0%
Lord Shen,

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:33.200 line:0%
is this truly what you think?

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:36.750 line:0%
I'm well aware of the hardship in the Prisoner's Center.

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:39.820 line:0%
I only wish

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:45.000 line:0%
for the truth to be revealed.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:06.480 line:0%
In the 8th year of Cang State's Shengli,

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.600 line:0%
Prime Minister Zhang Xingwei

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:10.440 line:0%
[Memorial Tablet of Shen Bingzhu, My Father]

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:11.220 line:0%
was ordered to end his life with poisoned wine.

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:14.540 line:0%
Prince Xian, Xiao Zhong, volunteered to guard the border,

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:16.379 line:0%
not returning for ten years.

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:19.600 line:0%
The Jinxiu Workshop's case was posthumously exonerated.

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:23.000 line:0%
Shen Bingzhu's case of colluding with the enemy was reinvestigated.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:24.640 line:0%
The Zhou family's officials involved

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:26.090 line:0%
were all punished.

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:27.580 line:0%
The Zhou family's relatives

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:28.840 line:0%
were demoted to their hometowns,

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:32.260 line:0%
never to return to Xiang'an again.

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:35.750 line:0%
The Shen family's name was finally cleared.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.670 line:0%
[Memorial Tablet of Shen Bingzhu, My Father]

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:13.000 line:0%
[Memorial Tablet of Shen Bingzhu, My Father]

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.680 line:0%
♫Grudges and debts, right and wrong♫

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:33.630 line:0%
♫The past is shrouded in blood and tears♫

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:36.260 line:0%
♫It's been a long time since we parted♫

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:35.709 line:0%
Father.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:40.090 line:0%
♫Can't fully explain the true story♫

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:38.880 line:0%
Mother.

00:05:41.060 --> 00:05:43.350 line:0%
♫Fate twists and turns♫

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:44.770 line:0%
I did it.

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:46.320 line:0%
♫Life and death, fortune and misfortune, always intertwined♫

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:48.620 line:0%
[Memorial Tablet of Shen Bingzhu, My Father]

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:49.010 line:0%
♫Obsession is hard to dispel, retain the true and discard the false♫

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:51.730 line:0%
♫Let the wind blow♫

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:55.640 line:0%
♫Through thick and thin, unwavering in heart♫

00:05:56.459 --> 00:05:58.430 line:0%
♫I'll be with you forever♫

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:03.090 line:0%
♫At least I have you to share both joy and sorrow♫

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:07.810 line:0%
♫Unravel fate, fearless and unyielding♫

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:10.860 line:0%
♫A dream brings me back♫

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:16.070 line:0%
♫The scenery is bright, hand in hand, we go back together♫

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:02.230 line:0%
In accordance with heaven's will and the times,

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:04.120 line:0%
I have received this clear mandate.

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:06.610 line:0%
The accusation of colluding with the enemy

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:08.320 line:0%
against the former deputy minister, Shen Bingzhu,

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:09.990 line:0%
has been proved to be false.

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:14.000 line:0%
The Shen family has upheld loyalty and righteousness for two generations, a virtue witnessed by heaven and earth.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.720 line:0%
The Stele of Loyalty and Valor is hereby bestowed.

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:18.100 line:0%
[Proclamation]

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:19.920 line:0%
All former retainers of the Shen family shall have their coffins relocated and interred with honor.

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:24.000 line:0%
All related family members, young and old alike, shall be treated with due favor and care.

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:25.640 line:0%
[Proclamation]

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:27.570 line:0%
Uncle Shen,

00:07:28.350 --> 00:07:29.520 line:0%
have you seen this?

00:07:30.240 --> 00:07:31.770 line:0%
He has cleared

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:33.730 line:0%
the Shen family's name.

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:45.240 line:0%
Clever.

00:07:49.350 --> 00:07:49.910 line:0%
Good boy.

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:00.320 line:0%
Mother,

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.160 line:0%
I was wrong.

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:04.600 line:0%
Please punish me.

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:06.940 line:0%
If I want to punish you,

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:08.800 line:0%
why would I wait till this day?

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:11.160 line:0%
Yong'an,

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:15.250 line:0%
I've decided not to punish you.

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:18.440 line:0%
It's not because of our mother-daughter bond.

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:20.510 line:0%
It's because

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:24.400 line:0%
you only donated to local troops.

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:26.600 line:0%
It did no harm to Cang State

00:08:26.720 --> 00:08:28.520 line:0%
and posed no threat to the state.

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:29.560 line:0%
If you

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:31.950 line:0%
had even a thought of rebellion...

00:08:33.589 --> 00:08:34.920 line:0%
I would never dare!

00:08:35.709 --> 00:08:37.640 line:0%
I have already surrendered all my private assets

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:39.040 line:0%
to the national treasury.

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:40.160 line:0%
My life

00:08:40.469 --> 00:08:42.070 line:0%
is at your disposal, Mother.

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:44.840 line:0%
Get up.

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:46.560 line:0%
Don't

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:48.360 line:0%
do that again.

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:52.880 line:0%
I will keep that in mind.

00:08:58.200 --> 00:08:59.000 line:0%
Yong'an,

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:01.080 line:0%
you think

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:03.170 line:0%
you can win the people's hearts

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:04.800 line:0%
by giving supplies and money

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.440 line:0%
to local troops?

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:09.560 line:0%
The so-called people's hearts

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:11.320 line:0%
can't be bought.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:17.240 line:0%
Now your brother is guarding the border.

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:18.800 line:0%
Shouldn't you

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:21.400 line:0%
do something for Cang State

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:23.000 line:0%
in Xiang'an?

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:25.810 line:0%
You don't need me to tell you what to do, right?

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.960 line:0%
I will certainly do my best

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:31.320 line:0%
to wholeheartedly assist His Majesty.

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:34.320 line:0%
Good.

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:36.600 line:0%
As it's said,

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.200 line:0%
the rise of governance

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:40.980 line:0%
lies in following the people's will.

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:42.600 line:0%
The fall of governance

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:46.120 line:0%
lies in going against the people's hearts.

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:47.850 line:0%
If the people resent hardship,

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:49.560 line:0%
I bring ease.

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:51.700 line:0%
If the people loathe poverty,

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:53.480 line:0%
I cultivate wealth.

00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:57.940 line:0%
Go on. Continue.

00:09:58.480 --> 00:10:00.040 line:0%
If the people fear turmoil,

00:10:00.060 --> 00:10:01.840 line:0%
I secure peace.

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:03.400 line:0%
If the people dread extinction,

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:04.920 line:0%
I foster growth.

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:08.080 line:0%
Good, good, good.

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:11.810 line:0%
Qi finally spoke!

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:13.360 line:0%
Qi.

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:19.730 line:0%
His Majesty has grown up.

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:21.570 line:0%
He's grown up.

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:22.960 line:0%
He spoke.

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:24.760 line:0%
He finally spoke.

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:33.480 line:0%
Aunt,

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:35.390 line:0%
come quickly!

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:38.110 line:0%
His Majesty spoke!

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:40.030 line:0%
Runing.

00:10:40.690 --> 00:10:42.330 line:0%
Greetings, Your Majesty.

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:44.210 line:0%
Get up. Get up.

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:46.280 line:0%
This is a family gathering.

00:10:46.320 --> 00:10:47.980 line:0%
No need for such formalities.

00:10:49.150 --> 00:10:51.410 line:0%
Your Majesty, I accepted the lily sachet

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:53.320 line:0%
you gave me.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:54.890 line:0%
But...

00:10:55.520 --> 00:10:57.920 line:0%
I prefer a night-blooming jasmine sachet.

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:01.320 line:0%
Runing,

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:05.440 line:0%
you didn't refuse my gift this time.

00:11:07.110 --> 00:11:09.110 line:0%
You've given me face.

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:11.440 line:0%
I'll remember this.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:14.510 line:0%
I'll give you a night-blooming jasmine sachet.

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:33.280 line:0%
In accordance with heaven's will and the times,

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:35.030 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:34.760 line:0%
I have received this clear mandate.

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:37.680 line:0%
I heard Yan Xing, Director in the Ministry of Justice,

00:11:35.140 --> 00:11:41.000 line:0%
[Full of Nature Bestows]

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:39.440 line:0%
is both virtuous and talented,

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:40.960 line:0%
and has solved many mysterious cases.

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:43.360 line:0%
She is hereby promoted to Director of the Ministry of Justice.

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:48.940 line:0%
[Cang State's Great Female Detective]

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:45.640 line:0%
I bestow upon her a personally inscribed plaque

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:47.240 line:0%
with the title of "Great Detective"

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:48.880 line:0%
to honor her achievements.

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:52.880 line:0%
Respect this.

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:54.520 line:0%
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:02.260 line:0%
Director Yan, please get up.

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:05.240 line:0%
It took us

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:06.440 line:0%
quite some time to deliver

00:12:06.440 --> 00:12:07.520 line:0%
the edict.

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:09.440 line:0%
We first went to Shen's Mansion.

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:10.320 line:0%
But unexpectedly, you

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:12.440 line:0%
came to your parents' home to visit your family.

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:13.660 line:0%
[Full of Nature Bestows]

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:16.290 line:0%
My Lord, thank you.

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.920 line:0%
We prepared hot tea inside.

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:19.250 line:0%
My Lord, please come in.

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:20.720 line:0%
I must hurry back to the palace to report.

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:22.650 line:0%
So I won't disturb you any further.

00:12:23.390 --> 00:12:24.940 line:0%
Thank you, My Lord.

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:27.030 line:0%
[Full of Nature Bestows]

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:27.120 line:0%
My Lord, please.

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:28.280 line:0%
Xing.

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:30.850 line:0%
Impressive.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:32.480 line:0%
Will there be a salary raise?

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:35.410 line:0%
[Cang State's Great Female Detective]

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:38.260 line:0%
This has brought glory to the family.

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:40.340 line:0%
This has brought glory to the family!

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:43.920 line:0%
This has brought glory to the family!

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:46.120 line:0%
This is the very first plaque

00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:47.760 line:0%
personally inscribed by His Majesty

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:49.560 line:0%
since he started to handle court affairs.

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:50.500 line:0%
Really?

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:56.140 line:0%
[Cang State's Great Female Detective]

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:52.720 line:0%
After I die,

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:54.120 line:0%
I can face

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:56.960 line:0%
the Yan family's ancestors with pride.

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:57.720 line:0%
Father,

00:12:58.040 --> 00:12:59.080 line:0%
why did you say that

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:00.400 line:0%
all of a sudden?

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:05.960 line:0%
I would very much like

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:09.360 line:0%
to keep this plaque in Yan's Mansion,

00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:10.920 line:0%
but in a few days,

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:12.160 line:0%
you should take this plaque

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:13.400 line:0%
to Shen's Mansion.

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:17.280 line:0%
Now that you're married,

00:13:17.070 --> 00:13:19.730 line:0%
[Cang State's Great Female Detective]

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:19.480 line:0%
it's not proper to stay at your parents' home for too long.

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:20.160 line:0%
Father,

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:21.920 line:0%
Shen Du and I already divorced.

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:24.050 line:0%
Why should I return to Shen's Mansion?

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:25.640 line:0%
Father, do you want to

00:13:25.640 --> 00:13:27.170 line:0%
drive me out of the mansion?

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:30.720 line:0%
Look at you.

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:32.660 line:0%
Why would I want to do that?

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:35.260 line:0%
[Cang State's Great Female Detective]

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.360 line:0%
You just quarreled.

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:38.160 line:0%
Don't let the sun go down on your anger.

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:39.840 line:0%
Silent treatment

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:41.320 line:0%
won't solve anything,

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:42.080 line:0%
right?

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:49.680 line:0%
[Cang State's Great Female Detective]

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:52.160 line:0%
Look at her.

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:53.120 line:0%
Look at her.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:54.880 line:0%
Since...

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:55.920 line:0%
Since she became the director,

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:57.780 line:0%
her temper has gotten even worse.

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:02.540 line:0%
[Wise and Insightful]

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:16.120 line:0%
My Lord,

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:17.120 line:0%
congratulations.

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:18.180 line:0%
Congratulations.

00:14:18.680 --> 00:14:20.960 line:0%
Your salary has been increased by 10% again.

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:23.930 line:0%
It doesn't matter at all.

00:14:24.120 --> 00:14:24.800 line:0%
Right, right.

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.530 line:0%
Money is a worldly possession.

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:28.650 line:0%
I, Wu Taiming, serve as an official

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:31.120 line:0%
not for fame or wealth,

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:33.360 line:0%
but for the ambition

00:14:33.360 --> 00:14:34.340 line:0%
of self-cultivation,

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:35.440 line:0%
household harmony,

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:38.240 line:0%
and state governance.

00:14:39.210 --> 00:14:40.200 line:0%
Yes, yes.

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:41.380 line:0%
You're right.

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:43.260 line:0%
But that being said,

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:44.820 line:0%
you were rewarded this time

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:46.300 line:0%
because of your

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:48.060 line:0%
righteousness back then.

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:48.890 line:0%
Right?

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:50.220 line:0%
You see,

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:51.570 line:0%
back then,

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:52.520 line:0%
Grand Commander

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:53.940 line:0%
and Director Yan

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:55.980 line:0%
were in deep trouble.

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:58.900 line:0%
Everyone else was avoiding them.

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:00.700 line:0%
Only you

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:02.600 line:0%
stepped forward.

00:15:02.600 --> 00:15:04.400 line:0%
You risked everything for them.

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:06.360 line:0%
I truly

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:08.160 line:0%
admire you.

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:09.080 line:0%
Completely.

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:10.030 line:0%
My Lord.

00:15:10.280 --> 00:15:12.120 line:0%
Little Feng,

00:15:12.520 --> 00:15:14.760 line:0%
do you know why?

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:18.870 line:0%
No.

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:21.850 line:0%
I have been an official for 20 years.

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:24.320 line:0%
The most valuable lesson I've learned

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:25.490 line:0%
is...

00:15:25.840 --> 00:15:26.640 line:0%
What?

00:15:29.020 --> 00:15:30.420 line:0%
Go ahead.

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:33.100 line:0%
Warming a cold stove.

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:38.660 line:0%
How and when

00:15:38.730 --> 00:15:39.530 line:0%
to warm

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:41.010 line:0%
a cold stove

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:44.620 line:0%
matters a lot.

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:45.840 line:0%
Warming a cold stove?

00:15:46.230 --> 00:15:47.380 line:0%
Little Feng.

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:48.560 line:0%
I'm Qi Yeyun, a constable of the Ministry of Justice.

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:50.090 line:0%
I'm here to report for duty.

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:56.520 line:0%
Yeyun?

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:57.240 line:0%
Yes.

00:15:57.480 --> 00:15:58.600 line:0%
I am

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:02.890 line:0%
Feng Gui, Head Constable of the Supervision and Arrest Bureau.

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:04.680 line:0%
Come here, everyone.

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:05.920 line:0%
Stop what you are doing.

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:06.840 line:0%
Hurry, come here.

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:07.680 line:0%
Come and meet someone.

00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:08.480 line:0%
Hurry up.

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:09.260 line:0%
Hurry up.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:10.840 line:0%
Hurry up. Move faster.

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:13.200 line:0%
I

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:14.680 line:0%
and everyone else

00:16:15.460 --> 00:16:17.980 line:0%
warmly welcome you

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:19.170 line:0%
to our big family

00:16:19.210 --> 00:16:21.370 line:0%
at the Supervision and Arrest Bureau.

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:23.520 line:0%
Welcome, welcome.

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:25.250 line:0%
-Welcome, welcome.
-Welcome, welcome.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:27.670 line:0%
Warming a cold stove.

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:29.020 line:0%
Alright, go back to work.

00:16:29.020 --> 00:16:30.100 line:0%
Qi Yeyun

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:32.160 line:0%
has been calling Grand Commander Shen Brother-in-law.

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:33.560 line:0%
That's definitely a hot stove.

00:16:33.560 --> 00:16:35.400 line:0%
What's the point of warming it?

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:38.560 line:0%
You still have a lot to learn.

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:42.200 line:0%
[Lu's Pawnshop]

00:16:44.490 --> 00:16:45.720 line:0%
Good.

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:47.380 line:0%
Father, do you feel comfortable?

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:48.310 line:0%
Yes.

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:49.520 line:0%
My daughter is giving me a back massage.

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:51.320 line:0%
How could I feel uncomfortable?

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:55.800 line:0%
Father.

00:16:56.170 --> 00:16:57.040 line:0%
What do you think?

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:58.790 line:0%
The laborer works hard enough, right?

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:00.180 line:0%
Of course.

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:01.650 line:0%
Working hard is good.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:02.920 line:0%
Daughter.

00:17:02.940 --> 00:17:04.600 line:0%
Every time we hired a worker for our pawnshop,

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:05.909 line:0%
they left soon after they came.

00:17:05.909 --> 00:17:06.960 line:0%
It's always been like that.

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:07.780 line:0%
Luckily, this time,

00:17:07.780 --> 00:17:08.980 line:0%
I have such a diligent

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:10.760 line:0%
and hardworking son-in-law.

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:13.869 line:0%
Langxing.

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:15.600 line:0%
Come. Sit down and rest for a while.

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:16.500 line:0%
Have some tea.

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:17.389 line:0%
It's alright.

00:17:17.389 --> 00:17:18.240 line:0%
I have plenty of strength.

00:17:18.240 --> 00:17:19.250 line:0%
I'm not tired.

00:17:21.869 --> 00:17:22.940 line:0%
Langxing.

00:17:23.149 --> 00:17:24.200 line:0%
I think

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:26.280 line:0%
you still need a set of gold armor.

00:17:26.280 --> 00:17:27.139 line:0%
How about this?

00:17:27.240 --> 00:17:28.640 line:0%
I'll order a set for you.

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:30.950 line:0%
No... No need.

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:32.320 line:0%
You already gave me

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:33.480 line:0%
a gold hat last time.

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:34.760 line:0%
I really don't need it.

00:17:35.190 --> 00:17:36.070 line:0%
Don't refuse.

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:37.380 line:0%
Listen,

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:39.040 line:0%
gold armor

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:40.500 line:0%
suits you best!

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:42.560 line:0%
It's... It's...

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:44.280 line:0%
too... too valuable.

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:45.720 line:0%
I really can't accept it.

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:48.850 line:0%
Do you want it or not?

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:51.240 line:0%
Yes.

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:52.400 line:0%
That's more like it.

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:54.330 line:0%
Just take what my father gives you.

00:17:57.940 --> 00:17:59.630 line:0%
My daughter is right.

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:01.360 line:0%
You can't refuse

00:18:01.800 --> 00:18:03.360 line:0%
a gift from an elder.

00:18:03.480 --> 00:18:04.560 line:0%
That's right.

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:06.440 line:0%
Okay.

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:10.840 line:0%
I... I'll get back to work.

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:22.880 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:25.000 line:0%
The Ming Hall's reconstruction and renovation project

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.120 line:0%
has been completed.

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:27.520 line:0%
As for Musician Jin's composition

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:28.240 line:0%
for the Ming Hall's reconstruction,

00:18:28.240 --> 00:18:29.960 line:0%
only the final section remains unfinished.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:31.360 line:0%
I have asked the palace musicians

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:33.080 line:0%
to complete the last segment.

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:34.680 line:0%
Please review it.

00:18:35.720 --> 00:18:36.800 line:0%
Good.

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:38.640 line:0%
Mr. Shen,

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:40.970 line:0%
I have the utmost confidence in your work.

00:18:41.560 --> 00:18:43.620 line:0%
The composition still lacks a title.

00:18:44.400 --> 00:18:45.400 line:0%
I am not talented.

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:48.120 line:0%
Your Majesty, please bestow a name upon it.

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:50.440 line:0%
All things are in place,

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:54.090 line:0%
and there shall be everlasting joy and peace.

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:57.040 line:0%
Call it Melody of Golden Age.

00:18:58.520 --> 00:18:59.920 line:0%
I've been thinking.

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:04.120 line:0%
On the day the Ming Hall reopens,

00:19:04.360 --> 00:19:07.440 line:0%
I want to invite the people of Xiang'an

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:08.960 line:0%
to go inside,

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:10.760 line:0%
so that they can share the joy

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:12.370 line:0%
and enjoy

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:14.370 line:0%
Melody of Golden Age together.

00:19:17.730 --> 00:19:24.940 line:0%
[Ming Hall]

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:59.750 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:16.660 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:19.600 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:20:20.040 --> 00:20:21.300 line:0%
Lady Xing said

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:22.660 line:0%
since you already divorced,

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:24.600 line:0%
she advised you not to disturb her further.

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:26.840 line:0%
Grand Commander, please go back.

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:39.560 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:20:31.920 --> 00:20:32.720 line:0%
Goodbye.

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:40.160 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:40.840 line:0%
this is already the ninth time

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:42.360 line:0%
your gifts have been refused.

00:20:42.360 --> 00:20:43.000 line:0%
I think...

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:43.760 line:0%
I think...

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:48.160 line:0%
it's because the gifts this time are not good enough

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:49.420 line:0%
and not moving enough.

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:51.170 line:0%
Xing,

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:53.600 line:0%
this is his ninth visit.

00:20:53.800 --> 00:20:56.260 line:0%
Grand Commander has shown great sincerity.

00:20:56.680 --> 00:20:58.550 line:0%
Don't be mad at him anymore.

00:20:58.600 --> 00:20:59.720 line:0%
Go home with him.

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:01.010 line:0%
Yes, Xing.

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:03.160 line:0%
He is the grand commander.

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:05.160 line:0%
If he stays at our doorstep all day,

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:06.480 line:0%
with the people coming and going,

00:21:06.480 --> 00:21:07.840 line:0%
it won't look good.

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:10.520 line:0%
Spare your husband some dignity.

00:21:10.520 --> 00:21:11.370 line:0%
Mother,

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:13.460 line:0%
Sister Caiwei,

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:14.320 line:0%
why are you

00:21:14.320 --> 00:21:15.680 line:0%
speaking in his favor?

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:19.240 line:0%
He wanted to divorce.

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:21.680 line:0%
I just fulfilled his wish.

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:23.600 line:0%
Besides,

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:24.480 line:0%
I didn't ask him

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:26.210 line:0%
to stay at our doorstep all day.

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:31.070 line:0%
Well, where are you going?

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:32.920 line:0%
To eat.

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:34.520 line:0%
I'm hungry, Mother.

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:36.340 line:0%
Then I'll cook for you.

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:37.600 line:0%
Be careful.

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:38.800 line:0%
Mind your belly.

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:42.160 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:21:43.730 --> 00:21:44.520 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:21:47.600 --> 00:21:48.680 line:0%
Let's go buy more.

00:21:52.380 --> 00:21:56.300 line:0%
[Yan's Mansion]

00:21:57.960 --> 00:21:59.240 line:0%
Really?

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:02.650 line:0%
The entire Xiang'an City is talking about it.

00:22:02.650 --> 00:22:05.300 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen have been refused nine times.

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:07.360 line:0%
And he's going to court her

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:08.640 line:0%
for a tenth attempt.

00:22:09.600 --> 00:22:11.880 line:0%
This is so funny.

00:22:11.940 --> 00:22:13.800 line:0%
Isn't that Grand Commander Shen?

00:22:13.800 --> 00:22:14.840 line:0%
Now the White Ghost

00:22:14.840 --> 00:22:16.560 line:0%
should be called the White Gift Giver.

00:22:16.560 --> 00:22:19.040 line:0%
Will his tenth attempt to win back his wife succeed?

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:21.450 line:0%
[Bijiang Gold Shop]

00:22:19.040 --> 00:22:20.600 line:0%
Look, they've bought quite a few gifts.

00:22:20.600 --> 00:22:21.880 line:0%
And they're quite expensive.

00:22:21.880 --> 00:22:23.280 line:0%
-It should work this time, right?
-Grand Commander.

00:22:23.280 --> 00:22:24.730 line:0%
I bought a set of the latest

00:22:24.730 --> 00:22:26.860 line:0%
earrings and hairpins respectively.

00:22:27.780 --> 00:22:28.580 line:0%
You carry them.

00:22:28.580 --> 00:22:29.460 line:0%
I...

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:31.440 line:0%
I really can't carry any more.

00:22:31.840 --> 00:22:33.120 line:0%
Why don't you ask more people

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:33.940 line:0%
to help carry these?

00:22:33.940 --> 00:22:35.730 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau is not short of manpower.

00:22:35.730 --> 00:22:37.040 line:0%
You don't understand.

00:22:38.410 --> 00:22:40.460 line:0%
The fewer people know about this, the better.

00:22:40.460 --> 00:22:42.200 line:0%
Is there anyone in Xiang'an City

00:22:42.200 --> 00:22:44.090 line:0%
who still doesn't know?

00:22:44.950 --> 00:22:46.150 line:0%
They don't know.

00:22:46.170 --> 00:22:47.360 line:0%
We support you, Grand Commander!

00:22:47.360 --> 00:22:49.450 line:0%
May you win back your lady soon!

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:50.680 line:0%
They don't know.

00:22:50.680 --> 00:22:51.760 line:0%
We support you!

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:53.760 line:0%
-Grand Commander!
-We support you!

00:22:57.430 --> 00:23:00.550 line:0%
[Bijiang Gold Shop]

00:22:59.560 --> 00:23:00.490 line:0%
That's good too.

00:23:00.830 --> 00:23:03.250 line:0%
All the young men in Xiang'an City

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:05.240 line:0%
should take this as a lesson.

00:23:05.320 --> 00:23:06.640 line:0%
They need to know

00:23:07.000 --> 00:23:10.130 line:0%
they should never offend their wife.

00:23:12.990 --> 00:23:14.690 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:23:14.720 --> 00:23:16.350 line:0%
Director Yan has arrived.

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:17.760 line:0%
Let her in.

00:23:17.920 --> 00:23:18.720 line:0%
Yes.

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:21.880 line:0%
She's here.

00:23:32.680 --> 00:23:34.920 line:0%
Greetings, Your Majesty.

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:37.760 line:0%
Get up.

00:23:41.480 --> 00:23:42.080 line:0%
Come.

00:23:42.720 --> 00:23:44.080 line:0%
Come closer.

00:23:51.120 --> 00:23:53.080 line:0%
I summoned you here today for two things.

00:23:53.080 --> 00:23:53.990 line:0%
First,

00:23:54.120 --> 00:23:55.900 line:0%
since it's a festive occasion,

00:23:56.000 --> 00:23:57.840 line:0%
Madam Xu and I

00:23:57.840 --> 00:24:00.040 line:0%
both want to have a casual chat with you.

00:24:04.720 --> 00:24:05.760 line:0%
Second,

00:24:05.920 --> 00:24:08.640 line:0%
I have good news for you.

00:24:11.880 --> 00:24:13.680 line:0%
Her Majesty has issued an edict,

00:24:13.720 --> 00:24:14.520 line:0%
replacing

00:24:14.520 --> 00:24:15.740 line:0%
the hereditary privilege in selecting officials

00:24:15.740 --> 00:24:17.400 line:0%
with merit-based selection.

00:24:17.630 --> 00:24:19.240 line:0%
From now on, regardless of one's background,

00:24:19.240 --> 00:24:20.980 line:0%
everyone will have a fair opportunity

00:24:20.980 --> 00:24:22.130 line:0%
to earn scholarly honors

00:24:22.130 --> 00:24:23.260 line:0%
and serve the state.

00:24:27.250 --> 00:24:29.000 line:0%
All scholars from humble backgrounds

00:24:29.000 --> 00:24:29.840 line:0%
will surely be grateful

00:24:29.840 --> 00:24:31.760 line:0%
for Your Majesty's appreciation of talent

00:24:31.760 --> 00:24:35.420 line:0%
and dedicate themselves to their studies in service of the state.

00:24:43.740 --> 00:24:44.340 line:0%
Go.

00:24:45.680 --> 00:24:46.280 line:0%
Next one.

00:24:47.200 --> 00:24:48.130 line:0%
Raise your arms.

00:24:49.880 --> 00:24:50.730 line:0%
Go.

00:24:51.970 --> 00:24:52.710 line:0%
Turn around.

00:24:54.810 --> 00:24:55.380 line:0%
Good.

00:24:57.360 --> 00:24:58.480 line:0%
Pan Chi.

00:24:59.590 --> 00:25:01.230 line:0%
It really is you.

00:25:05.640 --> 00:25:06.760 line:0%
What's wrong?

00:25:07.010 --> 00:25:08.210 line:0%
Can't I take the exam?

00:25:08.270 --> 00:25:09.560 line:0%
Of course you can.

00:25:10.080 --> 00:25:11.080 line:0%
We welcome

00:25:11.280 --> 00:25:13.600 line:0%
scholars from all over the world to take the exam.

00:25:13.600 --> 00:25:15.220 line:0%
But I heard

00:25:15.320 --> 00:25:16.240 line:0%
someone

00:25:16.360 --> 00:25:18.820 line:0%
was not interested in becoming an official.

00:25:21.400 --> 00:25:23.320 line:0%
One who stays near vermilion gets stained red,

00:25:23.320 --> 00:25:25.000 line:0%
and one who stays near ink gets stained black.

00:25:25.000 --> 00:25:26.780 line:0%
Your way of speaking

00:25:26.810 --> 00:25:28.810 line:0%
is more and more like Lu Chuichui's.

00:25:30.290 --> 00:25:32.490 line:0%
You're saying Chuichui is the ink?

00:25:32.520 --> 00:25:34.040 line:0%
I'm saying she's a pig.

00:25:34.060 --> 00:25:34.700 line:0%
You...

00:25:34.850 --> 00:25:36.360 line:0%
I'm not interested in becoming an official.

00:25:36.360 --> 00:25:37.440 line:0%
I'm here solely to prove myself

00:25:37.440 --> 00:25:39.200 line:0%
through this exam

00:25:39.470 --> 00:25:41.120 line:0%
and by the way, to examine

00:25:41.580 --> 00:25:43.010 line:0%
if the exam

00:25:43.040 --> 00:25:44.410 line:0%
is truly fair.

00:25:45.120 --> 00:25:45.920 line:0%
Fine.

00:25:46.760 --> 00:25:49.340 line:0%
Then take the exam seriously

00:25:49.800 --> 00:25:51.260 line:0%
and examine it carefully.

00:25:54.000 --> 00:25:55.200 line:0%
There are some things

00:25:55.240 --> 00:25:57.280 line:0%
I have long wanted to do.

00:25:57.840 --> 00:25:59.440 line:0%
It's just that

00:25:59.680 --> 00:26:01.080 line:0%
it wasn't convenient.

00:26:02.000 --> 00:26:03.240 line:0%
In my heart,

00:26:03.850 --> 00:26:06.550 line:0%
I have never forgotten Chen Baiyi.

00:26:09.650 --> 00:26:11.490 line:0%
I, on behalf of Chen Baiyi

00:26:11.520 --> 00:26:12.900 line:0%
and scholars from humble backgrounds,

00:26:12.900 --> 00:26:14.490 line:0%
thank you, Your Majesty.

00:26:20.530 --> 00:26:21.700 line:0%
Director Yan,

00:26:22.560 --> 00:26:24.320 line:0%
you always think for others.

00:26:25.080 --> 00:26:25.880 line:0%
It's time

00:26:26.050 --> 00:26:27.930 line:0%
for you to think for yourself.

00:26:28.800 --> 00:26:29.600 line:0%
Me?

00:26:34.800 --> 00:26:36.410 line:0%
What do you mean?

00:26:38.430 --> 00:26:39.640 line:0%
You see,

00:26:39.950 --> 00:26:43.270 line:0%
I've given scholars a chance to take the exam.

00:26:45.160 --> 00:26:46.330 line:0%
What about you?

00:26:49.800 --> 00:26:51.320 line:0%
Shouldn't you

00:26:51.370 --> 00:26:53.210 line:0%
give someone close to you

00:26:53.440 --> 00:26:55.520 line:0%
a second chance?

00:27:00.120 --> 00:27:01.510 line:0%
As the saying goes,

00:27:01.800 --> 00:27:04.600 line:0%
cherish the one before you.

00:27:13.320 --> 00:27:14.280 line:0%
Wake up.

00:27:14.440 --> 00:27:16.400 line:0%
Your mother is here to see you.

00:27:17.900 --> 00:27:18.930 line:0%
Mother.

00:27:19.360 --> 00:27:21.790 line:0%
Why are you waking me up so early?

00:27:21.880 --> 00:27:24.150 line:0%
Today is my day off.

00:27:24.170 --> 00:27:25.890 line:0%
Get up and get changed.

00:27:26.240 --> 00:27:28.700 line:0%
Otherwise, you'll be late for the ceremony.

00:27:29.520 --> 00:27:30.680 line:0%
What ceremony?

00:27:35.280 --> 00:27:36.040 line:0%
Everyone, come in.

00:27:36.040 --> 00:27:37.480 line:0%
Place the things properly.

00:27:37.480 --> 00:27:38.620 line:0%
Be careful.

00:27:38.650 --> 00:27:39.550 line:0%
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:27:40.040 --> 00:27:41.600 line:0%
Caiwei, be careful.

00:27:42.270 --> 00:27:43.280 line:0%
Place the things properly.

00:27:43.280 --> 00:27:44.180 line:0%
Put this over there.

00:27:44.180 --> 00:27:44.980 line:0%
Yes.

00:27:45.710 --> 00:27:47.290 line:0%
Be quick.

00:27:47.660 --> 00:27:49.730 line:0%
Be careful. Don't damage anything.

00:27:52.530 --> 00:27:54.530 line:0%
Be careful and gentle.

00:27:55.490 --> 00:27:56.290 line:0%
Mother,

00:27:58.120 --> 00:27:59.180 line:0%
what is this about?

00:28:03.390 --> 00:28:04.440 line:0%
Here's the thing.

00:28:04.610 --> 00:28:06.010 line:0%
I went

00:28:06.080 --> 00:28:08.480 line:0%
to the ancestral hall to ask our ancestors,

00:28:08.610 --> 00:28:11.040 line:0%
and then visited a temple oracle.

00:28:11.070 --> 00:28:12.460 line:0%
They said you

00:28:12.490 --> 00:28:14.570 line:0%
got married

00:28:14.610 --> 00:28:17.010 line:0%
without a proper ceremony,

00:28:17.040 --> 00:28:18.780 line:0%
and then divorced

00:28:18.920 --> 00:28:19.920 line:0%
for no reason.

00:28:19.970 --> 00:28:22.320 line:0%
That was great disrespect.

00:28:22.340 --> 00:28:23.700 line:0%
A serious taboo.

00:28:24.400 --> 00:28:26.360 line:0%
You deceived the ancestors

00:28:26.380 --> 00:28:28.120 line:0%
and the God of Marriage.

00:28:28.150 --> 00:28:29.320 line:0%
In the future,

00:28:29.400 --> 00:28:30.840 line:0%
there will be a calamity.

00:28:30.960 --> 00:28:31.980 line:0%
Mother,

00:28:32.360 --> 00:28:33.760 line:0%
so you mean

00:28:33.780 --> 00:28:35.270 line:0%
even the god won't allow me to divorce?

00:28:35.270 --> 00:28:36.360 line:0%
No, no, no.

00:28:36.580 --> 00:28:38.770 line:0%
I have thought it through.

00:28:38.840 --> 00:28:41.320 line:0%
If you want a divorce, divorce.

00:28:41.720 --> 00:28:43.840 line:0%
But the calamity has to be averted.

00:28:44.320 --> 00:28:46.080 line:0%
The only way to avert it is

00:28:46.160 --> 00:28:48.040 line:0%
to properly complete

00:28:48.320 --> 00:28:50.840 line:0%
the wedding ceremony first.

00:28:50.840 --> 00:28:53.680 line:0%
Once everything is formally done in the eyes of the god,

00:28:53.680 --> 00:28:56.760 line:0%
you can have a proper divorce then.

00:29:04.980 --> 00:29:06.370 line:0%
Yes, Xing.

00:29:06.600 --> 00:29:08.230 line:0%
I also consulted an oracle.

00:29:08.260 --> 00:29:09.820 line:0%
This calamity is bad for you

00:29:09.850 --> 00:29:11.770 line:0%
and the Yan family.

00:29:12.080 --> 00:29:13.480 line:0%
I'm a bit scared.

00:29:13.510 --> 00:29:15.020 line:0%
Yes, Xing.

00:29:15.550 --> 00:29:16.480 line:0%
You see,

00:29:16.510 --> 00:29:18.560 line:0%
Sister Caiwei is pregnant.

00:29:18.740 --> 00:29:19.730 line:0%
It's better

00:29:19.840 --> 00:29:21.760 line:0%
to believe it's true.

00:29:22.310 --> 00:29:24.610 line:0%
Than believe it's not.

00:29:30.370 --> 00:29:39.770 line:0%
[Wedding]

00:29:51.680 --> 00:29:52.480 line:0%
People should be with

00:29:52.480 --> 00:29:53.880 line:0%
those they love,

00:29:54.490 --> 00:29:56.070 line:0%
treating each other with respect

00:29:56.070 --> 00:29:57.600 line:0%
and cherishing each other.

00:29:57.980 --> 00:29:59.850 line:0%
Only then can they be happy.

00:30:02.070 --> 00:30:03.400 line:0%
From now on,

00:30:04.420 --> 00:30:05.950 line:0%
you won't be alone anymore.

00:30:07.720 --> 00:30:08.800 line:0%
I will do everything I can

00:30:08.800 --> 00:30:10.460 line:0%
to help you uncover the truth.

00:30:12.160 --> 00:30:13.640 line:0%
This virtuous lady...

00:30:16.500 --> 00:30:17.700 line:0%
is me.

00:30:18.450 --> 00:30:19.330 line:0%
You want

00:30:20.080 --> 00:30:21.400 line:0%
to seduce me like that?

00:30:41.250 --> 00:30:42.310 line:0%
Bride kidnapping?

00:30:42.660 --> 00:30:44.110 line:0%
Can it really work?

00:30:44.300 --> 00:30:45.340 line:0%
Yes.

00:30:51.800 --> 00:30:53.000 line:0%
Skip the formalities.

00:30:53.000 --> 00:30:54.660 line:0%
They're about to get married.

00:30:56.050 --> 00:30:58.280 line:0%
Who said he would hold

00:30:58.280 --> 00:30:59.240 line:0%
a grand wedding ceremony

00:30:59.240 --> 00:31:01.000 line:0%
for my best friend?

00:31:02.970 --> 00:31:04.570 line:0%
Having second thoughts now?

00:31:06.760 --> 00:31:07.760 line:0%
Of course not.

00:31:08.460 --> 00:31:10.260 line:0%
I'm just worried she'll scold me

00:31:10.600 --> 00:31:12.260 line:0%
if I don't tell her in advance.

00:31:12.440 --> 00:31:13.760 line:0%
How come you're nerdier

00:31:13.760 --> 00:31:14.920 line:0%
than Nerd Jiang?

00:31:16.920 --> 00:31:18.280 line:0%
What's there to fear about being scolded?

00:31:18.280 --> 00:31:20.240 line:0%
What you should fear is your wife ignoring you.

00:31:20.240 --> 00:31:21.240 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:31:21.280 --> 00:31:22.240 line:0%
when it comes to taking a wife,

00:31:22.240 --> 00:31:23.920 line:0%
you need the courage of a warrior

00:31:23.920 --> 00:31:24.960 line:0%
and should never give up

00:31:24.960 --> 00:31:26.020 line:0%
until you succeed.

00:31:34.400 --> 00:31:35.400 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:31:35.880 --> 00:31:37.130 line:0%
Congratulations, Grand Commander.

00:31:37.130 --> 00:31:38.170 line:0%
My wife said

00:31:38.200 --> 00:31:39.800 line:0%
although Xing is reluctant,

00:31:39.960 --> 00:31:42.220 line:0%
she still sat down for her bridal makeup.

00:31:45.640 --> 00:31:46.400 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:31:46.400 --> 00:31:47.660 line:0%
don't you understand?

00:31:47.840 --> 00:31:48.520 line:0%
Madam is

00:31:48.520 --> 00:31:49.760 line:0%
such a clever person.

00:31:49.800 --> 00:31:50.600 line:0%
How could she not realize

00:31:50.600 --> 00:31:51.600 line:0%
it is a trap today?

00:31:51.840 --> 00:31:53.120 line:0%
Since she sat down for her bridal makeup,

00:31:53.120 --> 00:31:53.760 line:0%
it means that deep down,

00:31:53.760 --> 00:31:54.960 line:0%
she must be willing.

00:31:55.800 --> 00:31:56.680 line:0%
Exactly.

00:31:57.080 --> 00:31:58.360 line:0%
The mighty grand commander

00:31:58.360 --> 00:31:59.440 line:0%
actually is not as clever

00:31:59.440 --> 00:32:00.440 line:0%
as Guard Jing.

00:32:04.600 --> 00:32:05.600 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:32:05.600 --> 00:32:06.440 line:0%
attack.

00:32:29.560 --> 00:32:30.360 line:0%
Let's go.

00:32:35.400 --> 00:32:36.200 line:0%
Xing!

00:32:36.560 --> 00:32:38.960 line:0%
I, your husband, have come to take you home!

00:33:27.480 --> 00:33:28.040 line:0%
Done.

00:33:28.120 --> 00:33:28.920 line:0%
Take a look.

00:33:34.770 --> 00:33:36.530 line:0%
So beautiful.

00:33:40.610 --> 00:33:43.070 line:0%
Truly my daughter.

00:33:43.400 --> 00:33:45.180 line:0%
So stunning.

00:33:45.740 --> 00:33:48.020 line:0%
Truly as beautiful as flowers.

00:33:48.050 --> 00:33:50.050 line:0%
I can't get enough of looking at her.

00:33:51.570 --> 00:33:53.180 line:0%
We look so much alike!

00:34:00.000 --> 00:34:01.060 line:0%
Mother,

00:34:01.200 --> 00:34:02.560 line:0%
come on.

00:34:04.880 --> 00:34:05.790 line:0%
Guys,

00:34:06.200 --> 00:34:07.880 line:0%
have you solved

00:34:08.080 --> 00:34:09.160 line:0%
the riddle?

00:34:14.950 --> 00:34:17.510 line:0%
A flock of white egrets fly into the blue sky.

00:34:21.800 --> 00:34:22.860 line:0%
Congratulations.

00:34:22.880 --> 00:34:24.979 line:0%
You've solved the final riddle.

00:34:24.999 --> 00:34:26.410 line:0%
Luckily, I'm here.

00:34:26.640 --> 00:34:28.160 line:0%
Otherwise, you blockheads would be here

00:34:28.160 --> 00:34:29.280 line:0%
solving the riddles till nightfall.

00:34:29.280 --> 00:34:30.120 line:0%
Yes, yes.

00:34:30.120 --> 00:34:31.400 line:0%
Chuichui is right.

00:34:36.800 --> 00:34:38.880 line:0%
The Yan family is a family of scholars.

00:34:38.880 --> 00:34:39.510 line:0%
If someone wants

00:34:39.510 --> 00:34:41.280 line:0%
to marry a daughter of the Yan family,

00:34:41.280 --> 00:34:43.160 line:0%
he must prove his talent.

00:34:43.160 --> 00:34:44.240 line:0%
For the next round,

00:34:44.280 --> 00:34:45.560 line:0%
you need to compose a poem

00:34:45.560 --> 00:34:47.090 line:0%
to express your affection.

00:34:50.640 --> 00:34:51.400 line:0%
It seems Grand Commander Shen

00:34:51.400 --> 00:34:52.840 line:0%
has made it to the second round.

00:34:52.840 --> 00:34:54.120 line:0%
It's not that easy to pass

00:34:54.120 --> 00:34:56.380 line:0%
Sister Caiwei's poem composition test.

00:34:58.680 --> 00:35:00.890 line:0%
Day after day, I drown my sorrows in wine.

00:35:00.890 --> 00:35:03.700 line:0%
I care not that my face grows thinner before the mirror.

00:35:03.700 --> 00:35:06.830 line:0%
Morning, I gaze upon the sky; at dusk, I watch the clouds.

00:35:08.470 --> 00:35:10.070 line:0%
Whether walking or sitting,

00:35:10.080 --> 00:35:11.340 line:0%
my heart is full of you.

00:35:29.120 --> 00:35:30.640 line:0%
Alone on the bridge, winds fill my sleeves.

00:35:30.640 --> 00:35:33.120 line:0%
The moon shines over the silent woods, as people return home.

00:35:33.120 --> 00:35:34.920 line:0%
With whom shall I share this joy?

00:35:35.580 --> 00:35:36.910 line:0%
Fortunately, I met you.

00:35:37.160 --> 00:35:38.360 line:0%
Now I may return home!

00:35:40.590 --> 00:35:42.390 line:0%
Thank you for showing up in time.

00:35:50.890 --> 00:35:52.620 line:0%
Your ears are red from the cold.

00:35:56.390 --> 00:35:57.730 line:0%
What are you doing?

00:35:57.900 --> 00:35:59.890 line:0%
I want them to see.

00:35:59.910 --> 00:36:01.910 line:0%
Confirm we are a harmonious couple.

00:36:14.980 --> 00:36:15.860 line:0%
Xing,

00:36:16.250 --> 00:36:18.120 line:0%
just go out.

00:36:18.180 --> 00:36:20.670 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen's poem

00:36:20.700 --> 00:36:22.170 line:0%
has made me

00:36:22.200 --> 00:36:23.490 line:0%
so envious.

00:36:24.000 --> 00:36:25.080 line:0%
Yes, Xing.

00:36:25.100 --> 00:36:26.820 line:0%
Ask him to stop.

00:36:26.850 --> 00:36:28.570 line:0%
We're too old

00:36:28.680 --> 00:36:30.240 line:0%
to endure this.

00:36:32.360 --> 00:36:33.160 line:0%
A good poem.

00:36:33.180 --> 00:36:34.340 line:0%
Brilliant talent.

00:36:34.370 --> 00:36:36.290 line:0%
You've passed the second test.

00:36:43.020 --> 00:36:44.480 line:0%
Please, Grand Commander.

00:36:48.840 --> 00:36:50.470 line:0%
The final test is about

00:36:51.140 --> 00:36:52.300 line:0%
martial arts.

00:36:52.600 --> 00:36:53.920 line:0%
You want to marry my sister,

00:36:53.920 --> 00:36:54.680 line:0%
fine,

00:36:54.760 --> 00:36:56.490 line:0%
but you have to defeat us first.

00:36:57.080 --> 00:36:59.940 line:0%
Otherwise, don't even think about taking her away.

00:37:00.880 --> 00:37:01.720 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:37:01.720 --> 00:37:03.050 line:0%
this round is in the bag.

00:37:15.160 --> 00:37:17.020 line:0%
-Don't move.
-What are you doing?

00:37:19.840 --> 00:37:21.100 line:0%
Grand Commander, run!

00:37:24.270 --> 00:37:26.230 line:0%
This is cheating.

00:37:26.960 --> 00:37:27.600 line:0%
You asked Mojie

00:37:27.600 --> 00:37:29.120 line:0%
to fight against a kid.

00:37:29.360 --> 00:37:30.480 line:0%
Is that even a challenge?

00:37:30.480 --> 00:37:33.300 line:0%
How about... a dance competition?

00:37:34.260 --> 00:37:35.270 line:0%
You lost!

00:37:35.360 --> 00:37:36.360 line:0%
What?

00:37:37.240 --> 00:37:38.040 line:0%
They...

00:37:39.960 --> 00:37:41.160 line:0%
defeated Shen Du?

00:37:47.560 --> 00:37:49.480 line:0%
I think he lost on purpose.

00:37:51.240 --> 00:37:52.240 line:0%
Bad news, Xing.

00:37:52.320 --> 00:37:53.440 line:0%
Shen Du lost

00:37:53.440 --> 00:37:54.080 line:0%
and left dejectedly

00:37:54.080 --> 00:37:55.740 line:0%
with his wedding procession.

00:38:35.200 --> 00:38:36.270 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:38:37.310 --> 00:38:38.430 line:0%
You didn't leave?

00:38:39.730 --> 00:38:40.770 line:0%
My wife is here.

00:38:41.820 --> 00:38:43.420 line:0%
Where could I possibly go?

00:38:52.370 --> 00:38:53.730 line:0%
Well, well, Shen Du.

00:38:54.900 --> 00:38:57.030 line:0%
You put on such a big show to deceive me.

00:38:58.780 --> 00:38:59.420 line:0%
I...

00:39:25.030 --> 00:39:26.230 line:0%
I'm not smart.

00:39:27.560 --> 00:39:30.560 line:0%
I didn't know how to coax such a clever person like you,

00:39:30.960 --> 00:39:33.460 line:0%
so I could only resort to deception.

00:39:37.580 --> 00:39:39.440 line:0%
Honey, you won't blame me, right?

00:40:02.480 --> 00:40:03.610 line:0%
Don't do that again.

00:40:09.840 --> 00:40:13.900 line:0%
♫The night is still young, and the moonlight reflects on the west window♫

00:40:14.850 --> 00:40:18.010 line:0%
♫There are stars in your eyes♫

00:40:18.730 --> 00:40:20.120 line:0%
♫When I touch you♫

00:40:20.950 --> 00:40:24.250 line:0%
♫My heart is like a flickering candlelight, shaking and swaying♫

00:40:25.300 --> 00:40:29.540 line:0%
♫The more I care, the deeper I hide♫

00:40:30.920 --> 00:40:35.440 line:0%
♫Leaves turn yellow and fall, and my thoughts run in thousands of lines♫

00:40:36.310 --> 00:40:39.420 line:0%
♫Time is like a poem, romantic and sorrowful♫

00:40:39.950 --> 00:40:41.690 line:0%
♫Two hearts♫

00:40:42.400 --> 00:40:45.640 line:0%
♫Collide between dawn and dusk♫

00:40:46.240 --> 00:40:50.270 line:0%
♫The embrace came as a surprise♫

00:40:51.490 --> 00:40:54.270 line:0%
♫I want to be with you, side by side♫

00:40:54.600 --> 00:40:58.020 line:0%
♫I want to keep you by my side♫

00:40:58.460 --> 00:41:02.120 line:0%
♫Through the obstacle of wind and rain♫

00:41:02.640 --> 00:41:05.010 line:0%
♫I want to be your moonlight♫

00:41:05.500 --> 00:41:08.890 line:0%
♫Accompany you until every dawn♫

00:41:09.150 --> 00:41:11.360 line:0%
♫How I wish♫

00:41:11.970 --> 00:41:15.400 line:0%
♫I could just forget the passage of time like this♫

00:41:16.050 --> 00:41:18.570 line:0%
♫I want to be with you, side by side♫

00:41:18.830 --> 00:41:22.330 line:0%
♫May we never forget each other♫

00:41:22.910 --> 00:41:26.280 line:0%
♫There will always be a place for us to meet♫

00:41:26.530 --> 00:41:29.310 line:0%
♫I want to be with you, side by side♫

00:41:29.820 --> 00:41:33.220 line:0%
♫When our black hair turns grey♫

00:41:33.540 --> 00:41:35.580 line:0%
♫In this life♫

00:41:36.350 --> 00:41:39.920 line:0%
♫I'll only cherish you in my heart♫

00:42:12.460 --> 00:42:13.930 line:0%
I look forward to hearing the patter of tiny feet!

00:42:13.930 --> 00:42:15.860 line:0%
Wish you a long and happy marriage!

00:42:19.870 --> 00:42:20.550 line:0%
Honey.

00:42:21.340 --> 00:42:22.780 line:0%
Let's go home, okay?

00:42:34.600 --> 00:42:35.560 line:0%
Going home!